Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================================
;  QuickVerse vendor dashboard — autoplay allowlist (FINAL).
;  Domain: vendor.quickverse.in
;
;  Allows the vendor order dashboard to play alert sounds without requiring
;  the vendor to click the page first.
;
;  This uses AutoplayAllowlist rather than AutoplayAllowed. AutoplayAllowed=1
;  would enable autoplay for the ENTIRE internet on this machine, meaning
;  every ad on every site blasts audio. Scope it narrowly.
;
;  Requires administrator rights (HKLM). Right-click -> Run as administrator,
;  or deploy via GPO / Intune / your RMM tool.
;
;  AFTER MERGING: fully close the browser (check Task Manager for lingering
;  chrome.exe or msedge.exe processes), reopen, then verify at chrome://policy
;  -> Reload policies -> filter "Autoplay". Status must read OK.
;
;  Policy changes only apply to NEWLY OPENED TABS.
;
;  To undo, use remove-order-alert-autoplay.reg alongside this file.
; ============================================================================

; ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chrome ---
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\AutoplayAllowlist]
"1"="http://vendor.quickverse.in"
"2"="[*.]quickverse.in"

; ------------------------------------------------------------------ Edge ---
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\AutoplayAllowlist]
"1"="http://vendor.quickverse.in"
"2"="[*.]quickverse.in"

; ============================================================================
;  URL PATTERN RULES
;
;    A bare "*" is NOT valid. It is rejected and the policy silently does
;    nothing -- it will still appear in chrome://policy, which makes this
;    a genuinely nasty way to lose an afternoon.
;
;    [*.]quickverse.in       matches the domain and all subdomains
;    http://vendor.quickverse.in  matches that exact origin
;
;    Values are numbered REG_SZ entries: "1", "2", "3"...
; ============================================================================
